### Payments through the gateway -> requires the JWT from auth-service/login.http
### billingAccountId: the account created when the patient was created (patient-service -> gRPC -> billing).
### Find it with: docker compose exec billing-db psql -U billing -d billing -c 'select id, patient_id from billing_account'
### Test cards: pm_card_visa (approved), pm_card_declined, pm_card_insufficient_funds

### Authorize ₹1,000.00 (amount is a STRING)
POST http://localhost:4004/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "billingAccountId": "{{billingAccountId}}",
  "amount": "1000.00",
  "currency": "INR",
  "paymentMethodToken": "pm_card_visa"
}

> {% client.global.set("paymentId", response.body.id) %}

### Get the payment
GET http://localhost:4004/api/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Partial capture ₹600.00 (send no body to capture the full amount)
POST http://localhost:4004/api/payments/{{paymentId}}/capture
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": "600.00",
  "currency": "INR"
}

### Void -> 409 after a capture (only an AUTHORIZED payment can be voided)
POST http://localhost:4004/api/payments/{{paymentId}}/void
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
